+  unreduced composition degree; it is no lower bound on any attack (§3.2).
+- `rs/src/params.rs` header: "collision 256 bits, quantum 170" — the
+  32-byte digest caps collision at 2^128 classical, 2^85.3 quantum.
+- `docs/explanation/parameters.md`: preimage 2^512 at cap 8 — the digest
+  caps preimage at p^4 ≈ 2^256; `docs/explanation/security.md` lists
