+conventions. "CICO-k": fix the capacity and all but k rate inputs, ask k
+chosen output limbs to take target values (the Ethereum Foundation bounty
+problem). generic cost of CICO-k is p^k permutation calls. margins are
+log2 of (attack cost / 2^128) for hash-level claims, or rounds left over a
+stated attack reach. "computed" means derived on this page and reproduced
+by a script in `audit/campaign/`; "published" means taken from the cited
+paper; "estimate" means a degree bound turned into a cost by the usual
