+### 4.2 terms
+
+- eligible: the first public, reproducible result on an instance, measured
+  against the frozen profile at the campaign's start date. a result must
+  ship code that runs against `audit/campaign/hemera_ref.py` or the Rust
+  crate at the pinned revision and prints the solution; CICO solutions are
+  checked by evaluating the permutation, nothing else.
+- complexity claims without a solution (tiers C and D) need a written
+  argument, a reduced-round instance where the method is demonstrated, and
+  an extrapolation the reviewers of §5 accept.
+- one payout per instance and tier; a strictly better result on an already
+  claimed instance (more rounds, or lower complexity by ≥ 2^8) is a new
+  claim.
+- the team, its contractors and anyone paid for §5 review are ineligible for
+  payouts on tiers A–B; reviewers are eligible for C–D.
+- results are public: the authors may publish when they wish after the
+  disclosure window below; hemera publishes every accepted result in the
+  results log with credit.
+- no claim reaches a payout by moving the target: the instance table is
+  frozen at the start of the campaign and versioned with this page.
+
+### 4.3 disclosure
+
+- tiers A–C: report publicly (an issue or eprint) or privately; there is no
+  embargo — these instances protect nothing that is deployed.
+- tier D, and any result that reaches a deployed mode of §1.2 (the chain's
+  proof of work, Merkle trees, particles, transcripts): report privately
+  first, 30-day window before publication; the team acknowledges within 72
+  hours, confirms or refutes within 14 days, and states in the results log
+  that a private report exists and its status without its content.
+- private channel: a GitHub private security advisory on
+  `cyberia-to/hemera` ("report a vulnerability"). private vulnerability
+  reporting is currently disabled on the repository — the owner enables it
+  before the campaign starts — and the owner publishes a contact key here:
+
+```
+contact key: [owner publishes an age or OpenPGP public key and its fingerprint]
+```
